rooms_desc ({"This is Bacchus house. It looks very nice, clean and you'd better leave it that way...","As you enter the room, you you are surprised... What a beautiful house this is.Wow. almost amazing what taste the owner must have...On the east wall you see a picture of his lovely wife, Sajt.You wonder what would be behind that north door...","This is Bacchus' bedroom.As you look around, you suddenly without any reason get a very sleepy mood...You wish that you were allowed to take a nap in that nice wooden bed...Maybe, if you ask the owner? He is a nice person...As you look around, you see a table, a desk and a colour t.v.A lamp is hanging from the ceiling and the floor looks massive wooden...Yes, really, this room must be the most beautiful bedroom you've EVER seen...Well, make yourself at home, and take a seat in one of the 6 chairs whichsurround the table...","This is the smallest room in HM.It is the water closet, or toilet.You don't know exactly what it is used for...Have fun!",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
